      "natural_statement": "The fresh Lean 4.31.0 stdin replay re-elaborates the eight printed wrapper roots using cached imports, not a fresh 92-source rebuild. Those roots do not directly encode September, arbitrary psi, total degree, or the complete fibre/nonrectifiability package, and compiler success does not independently approve statement fidelity.",
